flowchart TB
  %% As of 2026-10-19. Four entry paths; configuration evidence and unresolved handoffs.
  sdk_pr["SDK change → upstream PR<br/>eval-hub/eval-hub-sdk · models / client / adapter / CLI"]
  sdk_gate["S1 · SDK review and configured CI<br/>Effective main gate: PR + 1 approval; no required status checks<br/>Unit Python 3.12–3.14, lint/type, pre-commit, commitlint, Trivy"]
  sdk_publish["S2 · Publish and verify the SDK package<br/>main push → TestPyPI dev build; published release → PyPI<br/>SCM-derived version; OIDC environments; approval policy? Q7"]
  sdk_uptake["S3 · Update every affected SDK consumer<br/>Contrib PR: requirements + constraints / lock + adapter migration<br/>Verify installed SDK version; publishing alone does not rebuild"]
  contrib_pr["Contrib change → adapter PR<br/>eval-hub/eval-hub-contrib · direct change OR SDK consumer bump"]
  contrib_gate["C1 · Contrib review and configured CI<br/>Effective main gate: 1 approval + squash; no required status checks<br/>Path-specific tests; new-provider YAML; commitlint / security"]
  contrib_build["C2 · Build and push the selected adapter images<br/>adapters/** push to main or v* branch; manual rebuild available<br/>quay.io/evalhub/community-<adapter>:<SHA> + latest / branch<br/>Verify push, digest, actual SDK and supported architecture"]
  provider_config["P1 · Reconcile provider definitions when changed<br/>Contrib provider.yaml → EvalHub config/providers PR (G1)<br/>Image check skips new providers on PRs; drift check is post-merge<br/>Sync operator ConfigMaps; update image variables / resources<br/>Then join service and operator source promotion paths"]
  provider_select["P2 · Select adapter references and sync module manifests<br/>Operator params.env: base, ODH and RHOAI overlays<br/>Inspect: base latest; ODH / RHOAI v0.6.12 (not latest)<br/>Copy generated config into module manifests; operator PR → G2<br/>RHOAI branch mapping / rebuild or mirror / policy? Q8"]
  eval_pr["EvalHub PR → upstream main<br/>eval-hub/eval-hub"]
  operator_pr["TrustyAI operator PR → upstream main<br/>trustyai-explainability/trustyai-service-operator"]
  eval_gate["G1 · Required upstream merge gate<br/>1 approval + CODEOWNERS + latest-push approval<br/>Required checks + resolved review threads; up-to-date branch"]
  operator_gate["G2 · Upstream CI / merge policy ? Q2<br/>Controller + module smoke / manifest checks; Prow<br/>Which checks and approvals are enforced remains open."]
  eval_fork["G3 · Sync PR → ODH main<br/>opendatahub-io/eval-hub<br/>Hourly at :23 UTC / manual; conflicts fail; PR merge required"]
  operator_fork["G4 · Upstream sync PR → ODH main<br/>opendatahub-io/trustyai-service-operator<br/>Pull bot PR: auto-approve / enable auto-merge; cadence ?"]
  eval_promote["G5 · ODH main → stable sync PR<br/>Push to main / manual creates sync PR<br/>Gate: merge PR; resolve conflicts and destination requirements."]
  operator_promote["G6 · ODH main → incubation → stable PRs<br/>main push opens incubation PR; incubation push opens stable PR<br/>Module image has a separate main build (Q3)."]
  odh_images["ODH component image builds<br/>EvalHub stable → quay.io/opendatahub/odh-eval-hub<br/>Workload stable + module main → opendatahub operator images<br/>Tag: odh-stable; Konflux build / scan tasks (policy: Q4–Q5)"]
  rh_sync["G7 · ODH → Red Hat source promotion ? Q1<br/>red-hat-data-services/{eval-hub, trustyai-service-operator}<br/>Destination builds verified on rhoai-3.6<br/>Source branch / sync bot / cadence / approvals: OPEN"]
  odh_select["G8 · Select manifests + immutable image digests<br/>Daily 06:00 UTC / manual manifest-update PR<br/>Merge updated SHA / digest pins; eligibility policy ? Q4"]
  rh_freeze["G9 · Merge / backport into the release branch<br/>Branch-specific tests + approvals; freeze exceptions when enabled<br/>EA gatekeeper configured for 3.6-ea.1 / 3.6-ea.2"]
  odh_installer["ODH installer operator build<br/>opendatahub-io/opendatahub-operator main push<br/>Output: opendatahub-operator:odh-stable; path filters apply"]
  rh_images["RHOAI component image builds<br/>Release-branch push → Konflux hermetic builds<br/>EvalHub + workload + module → quay.io/rhoai/*-rhel9<br/>Four architectures; scans / attestations policy ? Q5"]
  odh_bundle["ODH development bundle / catalog path<br/>ODH-Build-Config pins relatedImages; bundle build<br/>Operator stable → bundle sync every 2h / manual<br/>Bundle → catalog nudge; processor / policy details ? Q4–Q5"]
  rh_nudge["G10 · Component digest nudge PR → installer<br/>rhods-operator build/operator-nudging.yaml<br/>Bot + one-file + title/version feasibility → auto-merge path"]
  rh_installer["G11 · Assemble + build RHOAI installer operator<br/>Processor: digests → operands map + source manifest metadata<br/>Prefetch matching manifests; publish odh-rhel9-operator<br/>Nightly/manual refresh is a separate route."]
  rh_bundle["G12 · Operator nudge → processed bundle / Helm<br/>Bot / file / title checks → bundle nudge merge<br/>Process CSV + relatedImages / Helm values, then build<br/>bundle-patch-only push is excluded from direct Tekton build."]
  rh_catalog["G13 · Bundle digest → catalog processing → FBC build<br/>catalog/catalog-patch.yaml nudge; process catalog content<br/>Refresh PCC + select bundle snapshot; build FBC fragment<br/>Policy / integration-test enforcement remains Q5."]
  rh_stage["G14 · Promote selected FBC to stage ? Q5–Q6<br/>Push To Stage: workflow_dispatch; select FBC / latest nightly<br/>Validate signed-image presence + catalog/PCC data<br/>QE sign-off, release-policy binding and caller / cadence: OPEN"]
  stage_output["QE-installable staged catalog<br/>Built stage catalog → OLM bundle → installer / module / workloads"]
  sdk_pr --> sdk_gate
  sdk_gate --> sdk_publish
  sdk_publish --> sdk_uptake
  sdk_uptake --> contrib_pr
  contrib_pr --> contrib_gate
  contrib_gate --> contrib_build
  contrib_build -->|if provider definitions changed| provider_config
  contrib_build --> provider_select
  provider_config --> eval_pr
  provider_config --> provider_select
  provider_select --> operator_pr
  eval_pr --> eval_gate
  eval_gate --> eval_fork
  eval_fork --> eval_promote
  operator_pr --> operator_gate
  operator_gate --> operator_fork
  operator_fork --> operator_promote
  eval_promote -->|stable builds| odh_images
  operator_promote -->|workload stable / module main| odh_images
  eval_promote -.->|downstream source handoff| rh_sync
  operator_promote -.->|downstream source handoff| rh_sync
  odh_images --> odh_select
  odh_select --> odh_installer
  odh_installer --> odh_bundle
  rh_sync -.-> rh_freeze
  rh_freeze --> rh_images
  rh_images --> rh_nudge
  rh_nudge --> rh_installer
  rh_installer --> rh_bundle
  rh_bundle --> rh_catalog
  rh_catalog -.-> rh_stage
  rh_stage -.-> stage_output
